    "body": "Pretty sure that EXIF tags should be respected (and as per https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5165#issuecomment-654127723 user agents should act as if it's baked in for opaque images to avoid leaking orientation in addition to width/height).\r\n\r\nSee also #7210 and #9693.\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/canvas ",
