    "body": "I think that’s right @noamr.\r\n\r\nWould be good to clarify in the spec that:\r\n\r\n- exif is respected\r\n- CSS overrides are not\r\n\r\n(perhaps a normative note about how ImageBitmap can be used if more control is required)",
