    "created_at": "2024-12-06T15:15:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-12-06T15:15:21Z",
    "body": "Coming back to this, I like the argument above that in canvas drawImage() we should always ignore CSS image-orientation just as we ignore CSS width and height.\r\n\r\nI have no idea whether this would break existing content in Chromium-based browsers (although such content is probably not interoperable) so I'll try to count such cases. It would also remove a possible forced layout in Chrome for same-origin images in drawImage.",
